  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウロコを　たたき　きもちを　つたえる。\nジャラコの　すむ　こうざんでは\nきんぞくおんが　こだまする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비늘을 때려 마음을 전달한다.\n짜랑꼬가 사는 고산에서는\n금속음이 메아리친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "透過敲擊鱗片來傳遞自己的心情。\n在心鱗寶棲息的高山上，\n迴盪著金屬的聲音。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il communique ses sentiments en frottant ses\nécailles. Les montagnes peuplées de Bébécaille\nbruissent d’un écho métallique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es übermittelt seine Gefühle durch das Rasseln\nseiner Schuppen, wodurch im Hochgebirge, in\ndem es lebt, ein metallisches Geräusch erhallt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comunica sus sentimientos haciendo sonar sus\nescamas. El ruido metálico producido reverbera\nen las altas montañas donde habita.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trasmette le sue emozioni scuotendo le squame.\nNelle aree montane in cui vive riecheggia spesso\nun suono metallico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It expresses its feelings by smacking\nits scales. Metallic sounds echo through\nthe tall mountains where Jangmo-o lives.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウロコを　叩き　気持ちを　伝える。\nジャラコの　棲む　高山では\n金属音が　木霊する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敲击鳞片，传递自己的心情。\n在心鳞宝栖息的高山上，\n回荡着金属的声音。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comunica sus sentimientos haciendo sonar sus\nescamas. El ruido metálico producido reverbera\nen las altas montañas donde habita.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとけの　ない　やまに　くらす。\nジャラコどうし　たたかいながら\nすこしずつ　せいちょう　していく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "인적이 없는 산에 산다.\n짜랑꼬끼리 싸우면서\n조금씩 성장해간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生活在渺無人煙的山裡。\n心鱗寶們會透過和同伴間的\n戰鬥而逐漸成長。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit dans les montagnes inhabitées.\nEn affrontant d’autres Bébécaille, il grandit\net se développe petit à petit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt auf Bergen, auf die sich kein Mensch\nwagt. Indem es gegen andere Miniras kämpft,\nwird es stetig stärker.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en montañas despobladas. Luchan entre\nellos para fortalecerse poco a poco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive sulle montagne troppo impervie per gli\nesseri umani. Cresce e diventa più forte poco\na poco lottando con i propri simili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They live in mountains where no trace of\nhumans can be detected. Jangmo-o grow\nlittle by little as they battle one another.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人気の　ない　山に　暮らす。\nジャラコ同士　戦いながら\n少しずつ　成長　していく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生活在渺无人烟的山里。\n心鳞宝们一边互相战斗，\n一边渐渐地成长。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en montañas despobladas. Luchan entre\nellos para fortalecerse poco a poco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　ウロコで　いわや　じめんを\nバシバシ　たたき　あいてを　いかく。\nおとで　なかまと　れんらくも　とる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 비늘로 바위나 지면을\n마구 두드려 상대를 위협한다.\n소리로 동료와 연락도 취한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用頭部的鱗片敲擊\n岩石或地面來威嚇對手。\n也會用這種聲音和夥伴聯絡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il frotte violemment l’écaille de sa tête sur des\npierres et sur le sol pour intimider ses ennemis\nou pour communiquer avec ses congénères.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit der Schuppe an seinem Kopf schlägt es laut\nauf Steine oder auf den Boden, um seine Gegner\neinzuschüchtern oder Freunde zu rufen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Embiste ferozmente contra las rocas o el suelo\ncon la escama de su cabeza e intimida al rival.\nEl sonido también le sirve para comunicarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sbatte con violenza le squame che ha sul capo\ncontro le rocce e sul terreno per spaventare i\nnemici e per comunicare coi suoi simili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It smacks the scales on its head against rocks\nor against the ground to frighten its opponents.\nIt can also contact its friends with these noises.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　ウロコで　岩や　地面を\nバシバシ　叩き　相手を　威嚇。\n音で　仲間と　連絡も　とる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用头部的鳞片砰砰砰地\n敲响岩石和地面，威吓对手。\n也会用声音和伙伴联络。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Embiste ferozmente contra las rocas o el suelo\ncon la escama de su cabeza e intimida al rival.\nEl sonido también le sirve para comunicarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきに　せなかを　みせず　たたかう。\nゆうかんな　せいしつから　こだいの\nせんしは　このんで　なかまに　した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "적에게 등을 보이지 않고 싸운다.\n용감한 기질을 갖고 있어서\n고대의 전사는 곧잘 동료로 삼았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "戰鬥時不會讓對手看見自己背後。\n因為性情勇敢，古代的戰士\n很喜歡讓牠做自己的夥伴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ne tourne jamais le dos à son adversaire en\ncombat. Les guerriers d’autrefois s’en faisaient\nun compagnon, car ils appréciaient sa bravoure.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Kampf dreht es seinem Feind nie den Rücken\nzu. Weil es so unerschrocken ist, wurde es von\nKriegern uralter Völker als Partner bevorzugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Combate sin dar nunca la espalda al enemigo.\nLos guerreros de la antigüedad admiraban su\nosadía y lo tomaban como compañero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lotta senza dare mai le spalle al nemico.\nI guerrieri del passato lo sceglievano come\nalleato per la sua indole coraggiosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It will never show an enemy its back in battle.\nAncient warriors liked Jangmo-o for its valiant\ndisposition and made it one of their own.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵に　背中を　見せず　戦う。\n勇敢な　性質から　古代の\n戦士は　好んで　仲間に　した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "战斗的时候不会让敌人看到背部。\n因为性格勇敢，古代的战士\n很喜欢让它做自己的伙伴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Combate sin dar nunca la espalda al enemigo.\nLos guerreros de la antigüedad admiraban su\nosadía y lo tomaban como compañero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　ウロコを　なかまどうしで\nぶつけあい　たたかいかたを　まなぶ。\nわざと　きもちが　きたえられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 비늘을 동료끼리\n부딪히며 싸우는 법을 배운다.\n이를 통해 기술과 정신을 단련한다.",
      "language": {
